<Text>&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt; &lt;?xml:namespace prefix = &quot;o&quot; ns = &quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in; mso-element: para-border-div; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .75pt&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .75pt; mso-padding-alt: 0in 0in 1.0pt 0in&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Automotive Radar&amp;nbsp;Practical Vehicle&amp;nbsp;RCS Modeling Example&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&apos;&gt;Keysight Technologies SystemVue&amp;nbsp;Workspace&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;************************************************&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;Simulation Task&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;************************************************&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;This&amp;nbsp;workspace provides an example of a&amp;nbsp;FMCW&amp;nbsp;Radar simulation platform. The design is more advanced with 3-layer architecture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;4 typical vehicle + VRU (Vulnerable Road User) scenarios from experimental results reported by world-class enterprises/research institutes are extracted for&amp;nbsp;system-level simulation&amp;nbsp;. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;************************************************&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Workspace Description&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;************************************************&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Example Highlights:&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;UL type=disc&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: SimSun; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-fareast&apos;&gt;4-Scenarios from 3 world-class enterprises/research institutes to cover typical anechoic chamber and indoor RCS measurement setups;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: SimSun; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: SimSun; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-fareast&apos;&gt;Various types of vehicular and VRU RCS data available;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: SimSun; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: SimSun; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-fareast&apos;&gt;Range-doppler spectrum plots for before and after CFAR are demonstrated. &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: SimSun; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;RCS Data Notes:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;The RCS data are extracted from the reference papers, with value selection options provided for each scenario as:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;UL type=disc&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: SimSun; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-fareast&apos;&gt;Scenario-01: minimum, mean and maximum;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: SimSun; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: SimSun; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-fareast&apos;&gt;Scenario-02 &amp;amp; 03: back/front peak, oblique peak (if any), side peak, minimum;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: SimSun; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: SimSun; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-fareast&apos;&gt;Scenario-04: mean, back/front peak, oblique peak (if any), side peak, minimum.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: SimSun; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Generic simulation procedures:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;1, Define the RCS extraction parameters in the equation: Step01-ScenarioX_RCS_Main, &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;2, Modify the system-level simulation parameters in the equation: Step02-System_Equations;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;3, Modify the AdvFMCW-Sce0X schematic for correct target scatter parameters (scatter numbers, ranges, velocities);&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;4, Run the analysis DFA_AdvFMCW with correct setups&amp;nbsp;of schematic and output datasets;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;5, Run Step03-Results_RDPlot for Range-Doppler spectrum plots with proper plotting configurations.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;The desired ranges, velocities are also provided in the equation tab of each schematic, and demonstrated in Scenario-01 schematic for their extraction methods. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Further Notes:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;I style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-style: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;1, RCS VS Range issue&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/I&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;I style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-style: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/I&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;According to publicized research results, automotive radar target RCS values are sensitive to the measurement ranges. Also, the designed scenarios, chamber setups and range gating filtering implementations also impact the results.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Due to detection limitations, the targets are NOT placed at their test ranges, but at near ranges. The Before-CFAR and After-CFAR range-doppler spectrum plots for each scenario are provided for user evaluations.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;I style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-style: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;2, Possible false detections&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/I&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold&apos;&gt;Besides the RCS uncertainties, the target detection results are influenced by the signal processing methods and the corresponding parameters (2D-FFT, CFAR, etc.). &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Scenario RCS Measurement Details:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TABLE class=MsoTableGrid style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; WIDTH: 517.25pt; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; mso-padding-alt: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184&quot; cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 width=690 border=1&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TBODY&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TR style=&quot;mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes&quot;&gt;&#x0