;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;(10 and 26 GHz)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Agilent E8363B VNA + mmW Module&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-spacerun: yes&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;(79 GHz)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&lt;/TR&gt;&lt;/TBODY&gt;&lt;/TABLE&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;EM&gt;3, Built-in Function Note&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 105%; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;There is one built-in MathLang function named &quot;AutomotiveRadar_DisplayRangeDopplerSpectrum()&quot; to help user plot the range-doppler spectrum mappling&amp;nbsp;with one CPI radar complex echo data. Please see the note below and refer to the&amp;nbsp;&quot;Step02&quot; equation for application details.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.45in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 105%; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;FONT size=2&gt;%%%%%%%%%%%%%%&lt;BR&gt;%% Function Note&lt;BR&gt;%%%%%%%%%%%%%%&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.45in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 105%; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; % Range-Doppler Map Spectrum Plot for FMCW Radar 1-Rx Complex Echo Data&lt;BR&gt;%&lt;BR&gt;% [USAGE]&lt;BR&gt;% DisplayRangeDopplerSpectrum(echo,Fcarrier,PRI,RangeFFTSize,DopplerFFTSize,RangeMax,ADCFs,ChirpDuration,Bandwidth,Name, DisplayUnit, Norm, DispLimit)&lt;BR&gt;%&lt;BR&gt;% [INPUTS]&lt;BR&gt;% echo: Complex Rx Echo Data (complex data in linear scale after dechirp);&lt;BR&gt;% Fcarrier: Carrier Frequency (in Hz);&lt;BR&gt;% PRI: Pulse Repetition Interval (in sec)&#xFF1B;&lt;BR&gt;% Range/DopplerFFTSize: FFT Size in Range/Doppler domain;&lt;BR&gt;% RangeMax: Range Display Control Struct:&lt;BR&gt;%% RangeMax.Switch controls the OFF/ON of Range Display Range switch (bool, 0 for OFF, 1 for ON),&lt;BR&gt;%% RangeMax.Limit sets the number of range values to be displayed (in number of points, unitless);&lt;BR&gt;% ADCFs: Sample Rate for ADC output data (sample rate after down chirp, in Samp/sec);&lt;BR&gt;% ChirpDuration: Chirp Pulse Duration (in sec);&lt;BR&gt;% Bandwidth: Baseband Bandwidth (in Hz);&lt;BR&gt;% Name: Figure Name to be displayed;&lt;BR&gt;% DisplayUnit: Range-Doppler Map Spectrum Display Unit Setting (bool, 0 for linear, 1 for dB)&lt;BR&gt;% Norm&#xFF1A; Range-Doppler Output Normalization (bool, 0 for No, 1 for Yes (normalized to maximum value))&lt;BR&gt;% DispLimit: Display Limiting Control Struct: &lt;BR&gt;%% DispLimit.Switch: Amplitude Display Limit Switch (bool, 0 for OFF, 1 for ON)&lt;BR&gt;%% DispLimit.Upper: Upper Limit for Amplitude Display (linear or dB, unitless)&lt;BR&gt;%% DispLimit.Lower: Lower Limit for Amplitude Display (linear or dB, unitless)&lt;BR&gt;%&lt;BR&gt;% [OUTPUTS]&lt;BR&gt;% Range/Doppler Spectrum Mapping Plot, New Figure created automatically&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;References:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold&apos;&gt;1, Scenario-01: &lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-spacerun: yes&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;I. Matsunami, R. Nakamura, A. Kajiwara. &lt;B&gt;RCS Measurements for Vehicles and Pedestrians at 26 and 79 GHz&lt;/B&gt;, &lt;I style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-style: normal&quot;&gt;International Conf. on SigProcess and CommSys, IEEE&lt;/I&gt;, 2012.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold&apos;&gt;2, Scenario-02: K.Geary, Joseph S. Colburn, etc., (Joint work by HRL Lab and General Motors), &lt;B&gt;Automotive Radar Target Characterization from 22 to 29 GHz and 76 to 81 GHz&lt;/B&gt;, &lt;I style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-style: normal&quot;&gt;IEEE Radar Conference&lt;/I&gt;, 2013.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold&apos;&gt;3, Scenario-03: Emna Bel Kamel, Alain Peden, Patrice Pajusco, etc., (By Telecom Bretagne MO, Lab-STICC), &lt;B&gt;RCS Modeling and Measurements for Automotive Radar Applications in the W Band&lt;/B&gt;, &lt;I style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-style: normal&quot;&gt;the 11th European Conf. on Antennas and Propagation (EuCAP)&lt;/I&gt;, 2017.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold&apos;&gt;4, Scenario-04: T. Motomura, K. Uchiyama, and A. Kajiwara,etc. &lt;B&gt;Measurement Results of Vehicular RCS Characteristics for 79 GHz mmW band&lt;/B&gt;, &lt;I style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-style: normal&quot;&gt;Topical Conf. on Wireless Sensors and Sensor Networks (WisNet)&lt;/I&gt;, 2018.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;</Text>
