<Item XName="Step01-Scenario4_RCS_Main" UserName="Step01-Scenario4_RCS_Main" Type="Equation">
<AutoCalc><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></AutoCalc>
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>%% This Equation contains the basic configurations for Vehicle RCS Test-Scenario No.4&#x000D;&#x000A;%% Reference Paper: &#x000D;&#x000A;% T. Motomura, K. Uchiyama, and A. Kajiwara,etc. &#x000D;&#x000A;% Measurement Results of Vehicular RCS Characteristics for 79 GHz mmW band&#x000D;&#x000A;% 2018-Topical Conf. on Wireless Sensors and Sensor Networks (WisNet).&#x000D;&#x000A;%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%&#x000D;&#x000A;%%Preliminary RCS Data Setups&#x000D;&#x000A;%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%&#x000D;&#x000A;%% Scenario Setup Mode Selection&#x000D;&#x000A;Scenario_Setup = 04; %% &#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;%% RCS Output Settings&#x000D;&#x000A;Sce04_No_Tgts = 4; %% Total target numbers (from 0 to 10)&#x000D;&#x000A;Sce04_Freq_Band = 02; %% 01 for 24 GHz (Only Mean Value Available), 02 for 79 GHz&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;Sce04_RCS_Type = [01, 02, 01, 02]; %% 01-02: Van, Pedestrian. (ONLY TWO kinds of Targets Available)  &#x000D;&#x000A;Sce04_RCS_ValueSel = [00, 02, 03, 04]; %% 00 for Mean, 01 for Back/Front Peak, 02 for Oblique Peak (if any), 03 for Side Peak, 04 for Minimum;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;%%RCS Output as SquareMeters&#x000D;&#x000A;Sce04_RCS = RCS_Output_VehicleSce4(Scenario_Setup, Sce04_No_Tgts, Sce04_Freq_Band, Sce04_RCS_Type, Sce04_RCS_ValueSel);&#x0009;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;</Text>
